@startuml

title SDHR Audit Access Records Sequence Diagram

autonumber "<color:Black>[00]"

skinparam ActorFontSize 16
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowFontSize 16
skinparam BoxPadding 5
skinparam DatabaseFontSize 16
skinparam dpi 400
skinparam EntityFontSize 16
skinparam MaxMessageSize 375
skinparam NoteFontSize 14
skinparam ParticipantFontSize 16
skinparam ParticipantPadding 5
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam roundcorner 15
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam SequenceBoxFontSize 16
skinparam sequencegroupfontsize 14
skinparam SequenceMessageAlignment left
skinparam sequenceStyle uml2
skinparam TitleFontSize 20
skinparam SequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor #EEEEFF50

scale max 260 width

actor "Health Practitioner" as USER
participant "SEHR" as APP #Orange
control "SDHR FHIR API" as FHIRAPI #LightBlue

== Record access ==

USER -> APP : Select patient and request information
APP -> APP : Record user action and request context\nin local audit record
APP -> FHIRAPI : Search or read patient information\nwith required access context
FHIRAPI -> FHIRAPI : Authorise and audit request
FHIRAPI -> FHIRAPI : Record access event
FHIRAPI --> APP : Return FHIR response or error outcome
APP -> APP : Correlate response with local audit record

== Verify sampled access records ==

loop Ongoing access verification
    APP -> FHIRAPI : GET /AuditEvent/$verification-samples
    FHIRAPI -> FHIRAPI : Identify eligible outstanding samples
    FHIRAPI --> APP : Bundle of sampled AuditEvent resources
    APP -> APP : Review each sample using an\nautomated or manual process
    APP -> FHIRAPI : POST /AuditEvent/$verification-submissions\nParameters with verification decisions
    FHIRAPI --> APP : Parameters with processing results
end

@enduml
